{#- Official TypeScript shared-enums template (design §22 G2).
    Registered under the target's `enums_file` name and rendered once,
    only when the schema has at least one non-empty enum. `emitted_enums`
    is precomputed in context (name order; `export` the uniqued binding,
    members carry uniqued keys and bucket literals). -#}// <auto-generated>
